ef":"#/texts/7","text":"40 USC 3318."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"15:46 Aug 08, 2019","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":18.654499999999985,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":96.31735000000002,"r":153.05585000000005,"t":24.66700000000003},"charspan":[0,18],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/8","text":"15:46 Aug 08, 2019"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"Public Law 116-30 116th Congress","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":569.5904678426052,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":183.0,"r":293.22720000000015,"t":593.664},"charspan":[0,32],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/9","text":"Public Law 116-30 116th Congress"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"An Act","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":555.5900678426052,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":322.7004,"r":364.66799999999995,"t":566.664},"charspan":[0,6],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/10","text":"An Act"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"To provide a lactation room in public buildings.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":540.3933785617368,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":254.76,"r":431.53999999999974,"t":547.776},"charspan":[0,48],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/11","text":"To provide a lactation room in public buildings."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Be  it  enacted  by  the  Senate  and  House  of  Representatives  of the United States of America in Congress assembled,","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":511.991723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":183.0,"r":503.8199999999998,"t":531.22},"charspan":[0,121],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/12","text":"Be  it  enacted  by  the  Senate  and  House  of  Representatives  of the United States of America in Congress assembled,"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"SECTION 1. SHORT TITLE.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":497.9933785617368,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":183.0,"r":299.48,"t":505.37600000000003},"charspan":[0,23],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/13","text":"SECTION 1. SHORT TITLE."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"This  Act  may  be  cited  as  the  ''Fairness  For  Breastfeeding Mothers Act of 2019''.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":473.591723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":183.0,"r":503.71999999999986,"t":492.82000000000005},"charspan":[0,89],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/14","text":"This  Act  may  be  cited  as  the  ''Fairness  For  Breastfeeding Mothers Act of 2019''."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"SEC. 2. LACTATION ROOM IN PUBLIC BUILDINGS.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":459.6933785617368,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":183.0,"r":403.58399999999995,"t":467.076},"charspan":[0,43],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/15","text":"SEC. 2. LACTATION ROOM IN PUBLIC BUILDINGS."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"(a)  LACTATION ROOM IN PUBLIC BUILDINGS.-Chapter  33  of title  40,  United  States  Code,  is  amended  by  adding  at  the  end the following new section:","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":425.291723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":183.00020000000004,"r":503.77019999999976,"t":454.52000000000004},"charspan":[0,156],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/16","text":"(a)  LACTATION ROOM IN PUBLIC BUILDINGS.-Chapter  33  of title  40,  United  States  Code,  is  amended  by  adding  at  the  end the following new section:"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"''§ 3318. Lactation room in public buildings","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":408.991723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":183.00020000000004,"r":406.2902000000002,"t":418.22},"charspan":[0,44],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/17","text":"''§ 3318. Lactation room in public buildings"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(a) DEFINITIONS.-In this section:","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":394.991723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":203.00020000000004,"r":364.33879999999976,"t":404.2201},"charspan":[0,35],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/18","text":"''(a) DEFINITIONS.-In this section:"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(1) APPROPRIATE AUTHORITY.-The term 'appropriate authority'  means  the  head  of  a  Federal  agency,  the  Architect of  the  Capitol,  or  other  official  authority  responsible  for  the operation of a public building.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":354.991723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":203.00000000000003,"r":503.7999999999996,"t":394.2201},"charspan":[0,225],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/19","text":"''(1) APPROPRIATE AUTHORITY.-The term 'appropriate authority'  means  the  head  of  a  Federal  agency,  the  Architect of  the  Capitol,  or  other  official  authority  responsible  for  the operation of a public building."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(2)  COVERED PUBLIC BUILDING.-The term 'covered public building'  means  a  public  building  (as  defined  in  section  3301) that  is  open  to  the  public  and  contains  a  public  restroom, and includes a building listed in section 6301 or 5101.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":314.991723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":202.9999,"r":503.77989999999966,"t":354.22},"charspan":[0,253],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/20","text":"''(2)  COVERED PUBLIC BUILDING.-The term 'covered public building'  means  a  public  building  (as  defined  in  section  3301) that  is  open  to  the  public  and  contains  a  public  restroom, and includes a building listed in section 6301 or 5101."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(3)  LACTATION ROOM.-The  term  'lactation  room'  means a hygienic place, other than a bathroom, that-","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":294.991723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":203.0005,"r":503.7344999999997,"t":314.22},"charspan":[0,105],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/21","text":"''(3)  LACTATION ROOM.-The  term  'lactation  room'  means a hygienic place, other than a bathroom, that-"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(A) is shielded from view;","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":284.991723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":243.0005,"r":366.7404999999996,"t":294.22},"charspan":[0,28],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/22","text":"''(A) is shielded from view;"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(B) is free from intrusion; and","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":274.991723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":243.0005,"r":387.4304999999996,"t":284.22},"charspan":[0,33],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/23","text":"''(B) is free from intrusion; and"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(C)  contains  a  chair,  a  working  surface,  and,  if  the public  building  is  otherwise  supplied  with  electricity,  an electrical outlet.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":244.991723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":223.0005,"r":503.6904999999997,"t":274.22},"charspan":[0,148],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/24","text":"''(C)  contains  a  chair,  a  working  surface,  and,  if  the public  building  is  otherwise  supplied  with  electricity,  an electrical outlet."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(b)  LACTATION ROOM REQUIRED.-Except  as  provided  in  subsection  (c),  the  appropriate  authority  of  a  covered  public  building shall  ensure  that  the  building  contains  a  lactation  room  that  is made available for use by members of the public to express breast milk.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":194.991723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":182.9998,"r":503.8197999999994,"t":244.22000000000003},"charspan":[0,284],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/25","text":"''(b)  LACTATION ROOM REQUIRED.-Except  as  provided  in  subsection  (c),  the  appropriate  authority  of  a  covered  public  building shall  ensure  that  the  building  contains  a  lactation  room  that  is made available for use by members of the public to express breast milk."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(c)  EXCEPTIONS.-A  covered  public  building  may  be  excluded from  the  requirement  in  subsection  (b)  at  the  discretion  of  the appropriate authority if-","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":164.991723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":182.99990000000003,"r":503.7848999999998,"t":194.22000000000003},"charspan":[0,166],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/26","text":"''(c)  EXCEPTIONS.-A  covered  public  building  may  be  excluded from  the  requirement  in  subsection  (b)  at  the  discretion  of  the appropriate authority if-"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(1) the public building-","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":154.991723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":222.99990000000003,"r":341.7898999999999,"t":164.22000000000003},"charspan":[0,26],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/27","text":"''(1) the public building-"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(A)  does  not  contain  a  lactation  room  for  employees who work in the building; and","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":134.991723202171,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":222.99990000000003,"r":503.7198999999997,"t":154.22000000000003},"charspan":[0,91],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/28","text":"''(A)  does  not  contain  a  lactation  room  for  employees who work in the building; and"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(B)  does  not  have  a  room  that  could  be  repurposed as a lactation room or a space that could be made private using portable materials, at a reasonable cost; or","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":104.99172320217099,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":222.99990000000003,"r":503.6698999999999,"t":134.22000000000003},"charspan":[0,169],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/29","text":"''(B)  does  not  have  a  room  that  could  be  repurposed as a lactation room or a space that could be made private using portable materials, at a reasonable cost; or"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"PO 00030","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":18.654499999999985,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":198.85355000000007,"r":228.12305000000006,"t":24.66700000000003},"charspan":[0,8],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/30","text":"PO 00030"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Frm 00001","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":18.654499999999985,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":235.12290000000007,"r":266.5504,"t":24.66700000000003},"charspan":[0,9],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/31","text":"Frm 00001"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Fmt 6580","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":18.654499999999985,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":273.55025,"r":301.0062499999999,"t":24.66700000000003},"charspan":[0,8],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/32","text":"Fmt 6580"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Sfmt 6581","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":18.654499999999985,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":308.0060999999999,"r":337.63309999999984,"t":24.66700000000003},"charspan":[0,9],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/33","text":"Sfmt 6581"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"E:\\PUBLAW\\PUBL030.116","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":18.654499999999985,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":344.6329499999998,"r":422.30794